  "summary": "Docker Engine daemon (dockerd) AuthZ plugin bypass via oversized request\nbodies. connaisseur links only github.com/docker/docker/registry and\napi/types/registry (client-side registry config and types), plus\napi/types/filters, pkg/homedir and internal/lazyregexp. The vulnerable\npkg/authorization is imported only by cmd/dockerd, daemon and plugin, none\nof which is compiled in. The fix ships only as github.com/moby/moby v29;\nthe docker/docker module path has no fixed release.\n",
